          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your faith enhances your ability to remove conditions. Add the following options to the list of conditions you can counteract for any type of mercy you can grant.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Mercy of the Body</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]; if you're 16th level, add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]</p></li><li><p><strong>Mercy of Grace</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]; if you're 12th level, add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Petrified]; if you're 16th level, add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]</p></li><li><p><strong>Mercy of the Mind</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Controlled], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]; if you're 16th level, add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned].</p></li></ul>"
