    {
      "fileName": "sense-holiness.json",
      "id": "UfgocXl8mpbgyotE",
      "name": "Sense Holiness",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "UfgocXl8mpbgyotE",
        "folder": "fZYwwdcMjGEKuulh",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Sense Holiness",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>The presence of goodness sickens you with its saccharine self-righteousness. You can sense the presence of creatures with the holy trait within 120 feet. This functions as a vague sense, similar to humans' sense of smell. A holy creature using a disguise or otherwise trying to hide its presence attempts a @Check[deception|against:perception|rollerRole:target|showDC:all] check against your Perception DC to hide its sanctification from you. If the creature succeeds at its Deception check, it is then temporarily immune to your Sense Holiness for 1 day.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "unholy"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Divine Mysteries"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "uncommon",
            "value": [
              "champion"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
